Z||000000||BAM-BAM||07-04-2000||05:02 PM||||  What kind of adhesive seal junk is it that was used to seal the taillights. I have a pair of notchback lights that are crystal clear and I need to put them back together. I just need to know what to use to reseal them. TIA<P> Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT||||reg||5
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||07-04-2000||05:33 PM||||BAM I've seen it at the Home Depot. It's a adhesive caulk that is sold in a roll like a rope, I think it's a window seal, or at least that's were I remember seeing it. but I guess you could any type of caulk/adhesive/sealer DAP makes all kinds of weather sealant/caulk<P>Hope this helps<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
