Z||000003||webbee||07-04-2000||06:44 PM||||Can you make a rubber gasket? I always hate that gasket in a tube as it's hard to clean back off.||||reg||5
Z||000004||hugh||07-04-2000||07:48 PM||||I'm not familar with how the lens is held on,but if you just need a seal material you can try your refrigeration supply.Ask for Permagum.You'll have enough to do every car on the East coast and it's relatively cheap.If you decide to try it you can get it in strips that are about 1/4 inch in diameter or in a big (I think 1 lb.)lump.It's white.<p>[This message has been edited by hugh (edited 07-04-2000).]||||reg||1
